@startuml
title exact-orb — N3: InputRequired и техническая ошибка BirthDataResolver

autonumber
hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    ActorBorderColor #64748B
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
    GroupHeaderFontColor #1E293B
    DividerBorderColor #94A3B8
    DividerFontColor #1E293B
    NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
    NoteFontColor #334155
}

actor "Пользователь" as User

box "CLIENT / API" #DBEAFE
    boundary "Frontend" as FE
    boundary "FastAPI" as API
end box

box "APPLICATION" #FFEDD5
    control "Orchestrator" as Orch
    control "BuildNatalHandler" as Handler
end box

box "SESSION STATE" #D1FAE5
    control "ContextService" as Context
    database "Session Store" as Store
end box

box "RESOLUTION" #D9F9FF
    control "BirthDataResolver" as Resolver
    control "Place / TZ dependency" as Dependency
end box

box "CALCULATION" #FFF7CC
    control "ChartArtifactResolver" as Artifact
    control "CalculationEnginePort" as Engine
end box

User -> FE : Отправляет данные рождения
FE -> API : POST /charts/natal
API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand

Orch -> Context : start_build(...)
Context -> Store : save BuildAttempt(PROCESSING)
Store --> Context : saved
Context --> Orch : build registered

Orch -> Handler : handle(command, SessionContext)
Handler -> Resolver : resolve(BirthInput)
Resolver -> Dependency : place / timezone lookup

alt Пользовательский ввод неполон, неверен или неоднозначен
    Dependency --> Resolver : candidates / validation facts
    Resolver --> Handler : InputRequired {\n field = "birth.place",\n code = AMBIGUOUS,\n candidates = [...] }
    Handler --> Orch : InputRequired

    Orch -> Context : finish_input_required(run_id)
    Context -> Store : clear current_build\n[optional: retain form draft]
    Store --> Context : saved
    Context --> Orch : confirmed

    Orch --> API : InputRequired
    API --> FE : 422 typed issues
    FE --> User : Подсвечивает поле\nи показывает candidates

    note over Artifact, Engine
    Calculation Cache и Engine
    не вызываются.
    end note

else Техническая зависимость resolver недоступна
    Dependency -[#C62828]-> Resolver : timeout / unavailable / exception
    Resolver --> Handler : ResolutionUnavailable\n(error_code, retryable=true)
    Handler --> Orch : ResolutionUnavailable

    Orch -> Context : mark_build_failed(run_id, error_code)
    Context -> Store : PROCESSING → FAILED
    Store --> Context : saved
    Context --> Orch : confirmed

    Orch --> API : 503 RESOLUTION_UNAVAILABLE
    API --> FE : retryable system error
    FE --> User : «Не удалось определить место\nили время. Повторите позже»

    note over Artifact, Engine
    Техническая ошибка не преобразуется
    в InputRequired. Engine не вызывается.
    end note
end

note over Context, Store
В обеих ветках ранее успешный
SessionProfile остаётся неизменным.
end note

@enduml
